          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131862,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang benar mengenai blok <code>continue</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Statement <code>continue</code> melewati sisa blok loop saat ini</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Statement <code>continue</code> menghentikan loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Statement <code>continue</code> dijalankan setelah loop selesai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Statement <code>continue</code> melewati sisa blok loop saat ini.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Block loop mencetak <code>Start</code>, mencapai <code>continue</code>, lalu memiliki baris untuk mencetak <code>End</code>.</p><p>Apa yang dicetak selama iterasi tersebut?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hanya <code>Start</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Hanya <code>End</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Start</code> dan <code>End</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hanya <code>Start</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 131863,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pastikan loop berhenti setelah <code>count</code> mencapai <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat loop hanya mencetak <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, dan <code>2</code>, lalu akhiri loop sepenuhnya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count == \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"break\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>==</code>, diikuti oleh <code>3</code>, dan terakhir <code>break</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 131864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang benar mengenai pernyataan <code>break</code> di dalam loop?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Statement <code>break</code> menghentikan loop sepenuhnya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Pernyataan <code>break</code> melewati iterasi saat ini</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Statement <code>break</code> dijalankan setelah loop selesai</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Statement <code>break</code> menghentikan loop sepenuhnya.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop <code>for</code> memakai <code>break</code> saat menemukan kecocokan sebelum item terakhir. Kamu menggantinya dengan <code>continue</code>.</p><p>Apa yang berubah?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop memeriksa item berikutnya, bukan mengakhiri pencarian.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop tetap mengakhiri pencarian saat menemukan kecocokan.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loop memulai ulang pencarian dari item pertama.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop memeriksa item berikutnya, bukan mengakhiri pencarian.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 131865,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pastikan <code>\"Loop finished!\"</code> dicetak saat loop selesai.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop finished!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop finished!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi loop agar mencetak <code>0</code> hingga <code>4</code>, diikuti <code>Loop finished!</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"count = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" count &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(count)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  count = count + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Loop finished!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"break\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"continue\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Loop finished!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>5</code>, diikuti oleh <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 131866,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang benar tentang blok <code>else</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Blok kode <code>else</code> dijalankan sekali setelah loop selesai</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Blok kode <code>else</code> dijalankan pada setiap iterasi loop</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Blok <code>else</code> hanya dijalankan jika body loop tidak berisi kondisi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Blok kode <code>else</code> dijalankan sekali setelah loop selesai.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu menjalankan loop dua kali tanpa <code>break</code>: pertama tanpa pengulangan, lalu dengan tiga. <code>else</code>-nya mencetak <code>Done</code>.</p><p>Berapa kali total <code>Done</code> dicetak?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dua kali, sekali setelah setiap eksekusi.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Satu kali, hanya setelah eksekusi dengan tiga pengulangan.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tiga kali, sekali untuk setiap pengulangan.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dua kali, sekali setelah setiap eksekusi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
